## Generate the Python project structure

Run these commands in PowerShell from the directory where you want the project created:

```powershell
$root = "student-task-manager"
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path "$root/app", "$root/tests" | Out-Null
New-Item -ItemType File -Force -Path `
	"$root/app/main.py", `
	"$root/app/models.py", `
	"$root/app/database.py", `
	"$root/requirements.txt", `
	"$root/README.md", `
	"$root/.gitignore" | Out-Null
```

This creates:

```text
student-task-manager/
├── app/
│   ├── main.py
│   ├── models.py
│   └── database.py
├── tests/
├── requirements.txt
├── README.md
└── .gitignore
```
